# Champagne kurulumu semantik; secim/hareket/duraklama/duzen emirleri gercek Windows girdisidir.
# 00-start sonrasinda 60 saniye: Space ile duraklat, Digit1-4 ve sag fare/HUD ile emir ver.
# 01-orders-paused gorununce 5 saniye icinde Space ile devam et; 30 saniyelik ikinci pencere.
# Son retreat/accept yalniz temiz kapanis ve sefer aktarimi kontroludur; zafer kaniti degildir.
new
lang ru
select champagne
expect ResolvedBattleCount 0
state 00-campaign-before
march
battle wait active 5
battle state 00-before-native-orders
shot 00-start
wait 60
battle state 01-orders-paused
expect BattleActive True
expect BattlePaused True
expect BattleSelectionArrived False
expect BattleHasOutcome False
shot 01-orders-paused
wait 30
battle state 02-orders-running
expect BattleActive True
expect BattlePaused False
expect BattleSelectionArrived True
expect BattleHasOutcome False
shot 02-orders-running
retreat
accept
battle verify-return
expect BattleActive False
expect Busy False
expect ResolvedBattleCount 1
state 03-after-return
shot 03-after-return
quit
